/AC2), or update parent epic e47b's AC2 to explicitly include docs/calibration in the corpus move (which re-stales its plan-review attestation) before this leaf certifies.","cohort":["G7"],"criteria":["G7"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.85,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Parent AC2: 'The research corpus (the docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/ tree) is moved to a top-level evals/ directory, rebar.toml sets corpus_root = \"evals\"' — names only docs/experiments","Parent AC2 verification grep: \"git grep -n 'docs/experiments' -- src docs scripts tests .github ...\" searches only docs/experiments, not docs/calibration","Parent title: 'research corpus out of docs' with the problem framed as '13 MB of executable research artefacts live under docs/' (the docs/experiments tree); docs/calibration is never mentioned in the parent description or its three-child decomposition","Leaf AC1: 'evals/ contains exactly the union of the former docs/experiments/** and docs/calibration/** files'; leaf AC2 grep: \"git grep -n 'docs/experiments\\|docs/calibration'\" — both add a second tree the parent does not contain","Parent's goal (harness exposure, corpus_root=\"evals\", research corpus out of docs) holds with only docs/experiments moved, so docs/calibration is added scope, not a required omission"],"finding":"The leaf expands the move to docs/calibration -> evals/calibration/, which the parent epic's AC2 contract does not contain. Parent AC2 scopes the move to 'the docs/experiments/plan-review-gate/ tree' with corpus_root=\"evals\", its verification grep targets only 'docs/experiments', and the parent description/child-decomposition never mentions docs/calibration. The leaf's AC1 ('exactly the union of the former docs/experiments/** and docs/calibration/** files') and its widened AC2 grep ('docs/experiments\\|docs/calibration') therefore step outside the parent's declared scope.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2dd2add619ecfe7d","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,